{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/08/16/itm_272e604e9f6884a6/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.13345","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-08-16T00:10:25Z","content_hash":"8fef21c24320b1316f5bfe79727b98087656ee5b91b0fb7eb11bae5e2f44fcef","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract and submission history","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.13345"},{"label":"arXiv HTML full text","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2608.13345v1"},{"label":"arXiv recent cs.AI listing","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2608.13345v1","fetched_at":"2026-08-16T00:10:25Z","fingerprint":"8fef21c24320b1316f5bfe79727b98087656ee5b91b0fb7eb11bae5e2f44fcef","id":"itm_272e604e9f6884a6","item_id":"itm_272e604e9f6884a6","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-08-13T15:15:09Z","reading_minutes":24,"sort_at":"2026-08-13T15:15:09Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"论文把 AI 安全架构形式化为训练期 character shaping 与推理期 rule enforcement 之间的资源分配 alpha，建立包含过滤器随规模退化、common-mode failure、character fragility 与 Pareto 重尾伤害的比较静态模型。作者在乐观/中等/悲观三场景下解析期望伤害并用 Monte Carlo CVaR 检查尾部风险，发现最优 alpha* 通常是混合解，随部署规模 T 只弱增长：乐观场景 +0.01，中等 +0.04，悲观 +0.21；真正主导设计的是 baseline character fragility rate，扫描 p_frag^(0) 会让 alpha* 移动 0.50，显著大于过滤器质量、尾部严重度或 common-mode failure 概率。局限是模型一维、静态、参数未实证校准，且假设尾部严重度与 alpha 独立，因此结论应读作安全测量议程，而非部署配方。","tags":["ai-safety","alignment","risk-modeling","rlhf","safety-architecture"],"title":"Rules or Character? Scaling Laws for AI Safety Design","title_hash":"4c10536c95d70155aefaaf6de78aeb37602a934aba093443ce9c0567f4894e82","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.13345"}
